  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Oruganti Sreenivasa Rao vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 29 November, 2022 Author: R. Raghunandan Rao Bench: R. Raghunandan Rao Hon'Ble Sri Justice R. Raghunandan Rao Crl.P.No.9458 of 2022 Order:",
    "facts": "The petitioners are accused in Crime No.412 of 2017 dated 24.11.2017 of Macherla Urban Police Station, for the offence punishable under Sections 273 read with Section 34 IPC on the ground that the petitioner was caught storing tobacco and tobacco packets. After investigation the police have filed a charge sheet before the Junior Civil Judge, Sattenapalli, who took cognizance of the case in S.T.C.No.29 of 2018. 2. The cases are being booked against persons, who are found to be either storing or transporting tobacco or tobacco products in the State of Andhra Pradesh. Persons, who are facing such cases, have been approaching this Court for relief.",
